      en: ["Son Doong Cave is over 9 kilometers long and stands up to 200 meters high.", "The park was declared a UNESCO World Heritage site in 2003.", "The karst formations in the park are approximately 400 million years old.", "There are over 300 known caves and grottos within the national park.", "The park is home to rare animal species such as the Saola and various macaques.", "The underground river of Phong Nha Cave is 7.7 kilometers long."],
      es: ["Un parque nacional y Patrimonio de la Humanidad por la UNESCO, conocido por sus cientos de sistemas de cuevas, incluida la cueva más grande del mundo.", "Ubicado en el territorio de la República Socialista de Vietnam.", "Juega un papel en la identidad local de la región.", "Conocido por su importancia paisajística o cultural."],
